```elixir
Loge.run!(
  Loge.Egglog.Engines.Egglog,
  "(datatype E (Num i64) (Add E E))\n(rule ((= x (Add a b)) (= y (Add c d))) ((Add x y)))\n(let e (Add (Num 1) (Num 2)))\n(run 10)\n",
  graph: false
)
```

## Linting

